  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IGAD &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ngsst&#xf6;d 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IGAD, 2017, Bridging Support - IGAD ISAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective(s) of the Institutional Strengthening Action Programme (ISAP) is to strengthen IGAD&#x2019;s capacity to deliver on its mandate of peace, prosperity and regional integration by improving it management systems and processes (including procurement), its communication systems and services and enhancing its IT.&#xa0;
The supported activities of IGAD&#x2019;s Peace and Security Division (PSD) relate to all core intervention areas including CEWARN, Preventive Diplomacy and Mediation, Peace Support Offices, Security Sector Program and Political Affairs Programme.&#xa0;As this support is an earmarked support, it especially regards activities related to IGAD&#x2019;s Conflict Early Warning and Response Mechanism (CEWARN); Preventive diplomacy and mediation; the IGAD Office on Sudan; Transnational Security Threats; Governance, Democracy and Human Rights in addition to Crosscutting issues: Gender and Programme coordination/management.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging support for IGADs institutional development program and their department for Peace and security.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xd6;verg&#xe5;ngsst&#xf6;d till IGADs institutionsutvecklingsprogram och avdelning f&#xf6;r fred och s&#xe4;kerhet f&#xf6;r 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
